{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "note": "Standard output profiles for the stills lane. A client overlay may only narrow these. crop_height_in_face_heights is the crop's height as a multiple of the main face's box height (Vision's box runs forehead to chin); eye_line is where the face box's eye line lands from the top of the crop. union profiles fit every counted face and ignore both.",
